      "writtenOn": "2021-07-08T03:34:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ANDROID_OEM_DATA_ARRAY() was added for Android 12 kernels. Please see https://docs.partner.android.com/partners/guides/gki/kernel-code#adding-vendor-fields-to-structures.\n\nBasically, if you are an OEM and want to reserve data fields in a struct, you must use the OEM variant. If you use the VENDOR variant then they are reserved for SoC vendors.\n\nKMI freeze is July 14. So just do it.",
      "parentUuid": "61ce5f88_6b39faac",
      "revId": "5e6ffc8e266b69baab534167127ab891fa06c619",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
